OL,3,AYemeni military says it has 'secured'
OL,4,ARed Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemeni pro-government forces backed by
OL,7,FSaudi Arabia say they have "secured"
OL,8,Fthe Bab al-Mandab Strait at the
OL,9,Fsouthern end of the Red Sea, at the
OL,10,Fstart of a major offensive against the
OL,11,FIran-backed Houthi movement.
OL,13,FThe Yemeni military also said in a
OL,14,Fstatement that its forces had captured
OL,15,Fthe Red Sea city of Mokha on Monday
OL,16,Fafternoon with the help of Saudi air
OL,17,Fstrikes.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
