OL,3,AYemeni military says it has 'secured'
OL,4,ARed Sea waterway
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut in conflicting reports, unnamed
OL,7,FYemeni government and military sources
OL,8,Flater told news agencies Reuters and
OL,9,FAFP that the forces had only reached
OL,10,Fthe city's outskirts.
OL,12,FThe Houthis denied losing Bab al-Mandab
OL,13,Fand Mokha and said they had struck
OL,14,FRiyadh's airport and other locations in
OL,15,FSaudi Arabia in retaliation for the air
OL,16,Fstrikes.
